### ============================================
### PROFILE - Alle endpoints
### ============================================
### Deze file bevat alle endpoints voor gebruikersprofiel.
### Zorg dat je eerst ingelogd bent (auth.rest) om een token te hebben.
### ============================================

### VARIABELEN
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5082
@contentType = application/json

### TOKEN - Vul dit in na login (kopieer uit auth.rest response)
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HIER 

### ============================================
### GET ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 1. GET PROFILE - Haal profiel van ingelogde gebruiker op
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### PUT ENDPOINTS - UPDATE
### ============================================

### 2. UPDATE PROFILE - Update naam
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Updated Naam"
}

### 3. UPDATE PROFILE - Update email
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nieuwemail@example.com"
}

### 4. UPDATE PROFILE - Update telefoonnummer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ZFP3aX4Te4rsWp2tV15Q8hSTp_G7E_5gvz6PS1um1zQ
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "phoneNumber": "+31698765432"
}

### 5. UPDATE PROFILE - Update geboortejaar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "birthYear": 1991
}

### 6. UPDATE PROFILE - Update wachtwoord
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "password": "NieuwWachtwoord123!"
}

### 7. UPDATE PROFILE - Update meerdere velden tegelijk
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Volledig Geüpdatet",
  "email": "volledig@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+31611111111",
  "birthYear": 1992
}

### ============================================
### DELETE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 8. DELETE PROFILE - Verwijder profiel (zet op inactive)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ZFP3aX4Te4rsWp2tV15Q8hSTp_G7E_5gvz6PS1um1zQ
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

